SAMM original annotation snapshot

Dataset: SAMM (Semantic-Coordinated Multimodal Manipulation)
Authors: Jinjie Shen, Yaxiong Wang, Lechao Chen, Pu Nan, Zhun Zhong
Publication: Beyond Artificial Misalignment: Detecting and Grounding
Semantic-Coordinated Multimodal Manipulation, ACM Multimedia 2025.
Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.12653
Dataset: https://huggingface.co/datasets/SJJ0854/SAMM
Official code: https://github.com/shen8424/SAMM-RamDG-CAP

The train.json, val.json and test.json files are unchanged copies of
SAMM-without-CAP at publisher dataset revision:
9ff6eafbe04f13e9ad8df6bc09a63f9f7a24f3f4

The dataset card at that revision declares Apache License 2.0. A copy is
included as LICENSE in this directory. The accompanying HERI subset manifest
records the source identities and selection recipe. This distribution
contains annotation JSON files only; image files must be obtained separately.
